From eefdf0f0bbc6fd448fb702e6b541b1d1f7f432f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hibreak <build@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:30:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] e-ink: Noto Sans 450 for sans-serif

sans-serif (every app's default) uses Noto Sans (variable, wdth 100) on the
e-ink 450 weight curve: 400 -> 450, 500 -> 550, 700 -> 750, 100 lifted to
200, 900 kept. Roboto stays as "roboto", for condensed text and as the
first fallback family, so characters Noto Sans lacks fall back to Roboto.
Generated by scripts/dev/eink-fonts.py (docs/eink-fonts.md).

Change-Id: I398ea4b49ea21ef27176481427918e1a19ce2da7
---
 font_config.json | 169 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 169 insertions(+)

